---
description: Core rules for portugalhqacitizenship.com
alwaysApply: true
---

Before any task, read AGENTS.md in the repo root and follow it exactly.

Most important:
- Honesty overrides SEO. Never invent facts, fees, dates, reviews or testimonials.
- Program facts only from src/data/facts.ts. Approved copy in docs/content/ is used word for word.
- Never write HQA® or HQA™. No company name anywhere.
- No em dashes. No lazy loading. One H1 in Title Case, H2 to H6 in sentence case.
- Run the 5-location keyword check on every page.
- Run `npm run build` after changes. Never commit, push or deploy unless asked.
